+++ b/changes/476.fixed.md
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+Return dedicated `CapsuleError::AlreadyRegistered` and
+`CapsuleError::UplinkAlreadyRegistered` errors when a capsule or uplink is
+registered twice, instead of `UnsupportedEntryPoint`. The error messages no
+longer carry the misleading "Unsupported entry point:" prefix, and the
+registry's `# Errors` docs now name the variants callers can match on.
+
+Closes #476
